      "writtenOn": "2019-10-02T22:53:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yicheng, here is an example of how to set \"-Wvla\" for all of the fpsensor files:\n\n diff --git a/common/fpsensor/build.mk b/common/fpsensor/build.mk\nindex 9556515f2..3af81d7f8 100644\n--- a/common/fpsensor/build.mk\n+++ b/common/fpsensor/build.mk\n@@ -7,11 +7,24 @@\n # Note that this variable includes the trailing \"/\"\n _fpsensor_dir:\u003d$(dir $(lastword $(MAKEFILE_LIST)))\n \n-all-obj-$(HAS_TASK_FPSENSOR)+\u003d$(_fpsensor_dir)fpsensor_state.o\n-all-obj-$(HAS_TASK_FPSENSOR)+\u003d$(_fpsensor_dir)fpsensor_crypto.o\n+# Additional CFLAGS for only fpsensor objects\n+fpsensor_CFLAGS\u003d-Wvla\n+\n+_fpsensor_state_obj:\u003d$(_fpsensor_dir)fpsensor_state.o\n+_fpsensor_crypto_obj:\u003d$(_fpsensor_dir)fpsensor_crypto.o\n+_fpsensor_obj:\u003d$(_fpsensor_dir)fpsensor.o\n+_fpsensor_stubs_obj:\u003d$(_fpsensor_dir)fpsensor_stubs.o\n+\n+$(out)/RW/$(_fpsensor_state_obj): CFLAGS+\u003d$(fpsensor_CFLAGS)\n+$(out)/RW/$(_fpsensor_crypto_obj): CFLAGS+\u003d$(fpsensor_CFLAGS)\n+$(out)/RW/$(_fpsensor_obj): CFLAGS+\u003d$(fpsensor_CFLAGS)\n+$(out)/RW/$(_fpsensor_stubs_obj): CFLAGS+\u003d$(fpsensor_CFLAGS)\n+\n+all-obj-$(HAS_TASK_FPSENSOR)+\u003d$(_fpsensor_state_obj)\n+all-obj-$(HAS_TASK_FPSENSOR)+\u003d$(_fpsensor_crypto_obj)\n ifneq ($(CONFIG_SPI_FP_PORT),)\n-all-obj-$(HAS_TASK_FPSENSOR)+\u003d$(_fpsensor_dir)fpsensor.o\n+all-obj-$(HAS_TASK_FPSENSOR)+\u003d$(_fpsensor_obj)\n endif\n ifeq ($(HAS_MOCK_FPSENSOR),)\n-all-obj-$(HAS_TASK_FPSENSOR)+\u003d$(_fpsensor_dir)fpsensor_stubs.o\n+all-obj-$(HAS_TASK_FPSENSOR)+\u003d$(_fpsensor_stubs-obj)\n endif\n\n\nWe can consider setting it globally too, but will have to fix some existing cases across the codebase.",
